  "description": ".NET for macOS (AppKit) bindings for the audio surface of the Agora macOS RTC SDK (AgoraRtcEngine_macOS 4.6.2). Lets a native .NET for macOS app join Agora RTC channels and publish/subscribe audio, with an audio-only API. Use Net.Agora.Video.Mac instead if the app ever shows or sends video — the two are mutually exclusive. Hand-written against the real headers — see ApiDefinition.cs.",
